     "body": "<p>I did some research verifying the backup using leveldb python module, as well by checking the manifest file. Updated the documentation with possible backup strategies.  I'm yet to create and test scripts to support the verification of the backups. I'm planning to do that towards the end of this week.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Backup+and+Restore\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Backup+and+Restore</a></p>",
     "created": "09/Nov/15 12:56 PM",
